PyInstaller 6.22.3 (pyinstaller-hooks-contrib 2026.9, PyQt6 6.11.0, Qt 6.11.2, Python 3.14.10) on Windows 11, in a throwaway
venv (%TEMP%\m10-pyi, installed --require-hashes from a uv lock made with --exclude-newer 2026-10-31), running the real
packaging/chatmon.spec on scratch copies of the tree. Windows stands in for macOS here: the spec and the hooks are the
same, the onedir layout puts sys._MEIPASS at Chatmon/_internal instead of Chatmon.app/Contents/Frameworks, and BUNDLE
does nothing off macOS. packaging/macos/entry.py is replaced by a probe (below) that sets up i18n and writes what it found.

